finding: The regression test does not hold its stated class-wide rule: bundle-pipelines.gpu.test.ts:62-86 creates only one default opaque StandardMaterial, one default-AA camera, and one directional light. It never records point/spot shadow pipelines, other alpha-mode prepasses, AA-off variants, stacked AlphaToCoverage, or custom-varying paths, and asserts only existence of prepass/cascade labels. Removing the fragment stage from the point-shadow pipeline at pipelines.ts:2089, for example, leaves this test green because no point light ever records it. The implementation appears to cover existing constructors by inspection, but the claimed every-bundled-pipeline regression protection is missing; enumerate the applicable families/variants and assert each is actually recorded.
